{"3948370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Your Forever Friend", "steam_appid": 3948370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948370/extras/357c95c79232daf6a43eb684bdcaedc1.poster.avif?t=1782483731\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948370/extras/357c95c79232daf6a43eb684bdcaedc1.webm?t=1782483731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948370/extras/357c95c79232daf6a43eb684bdcaedc1.mp4?t=1782483731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Forever Friend is the ideal solution to never feel lonely again! Delivered with the perfect Personal Virtual Space, it accompanies you all the time! Play video games, listen to music together, reminisce about buried memories... It's impossible to get bored with a friend! And there are absolutely no problems with it. NONE! ^_^</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If you experience any issues with your Forever Friend, please contact a member of E.C.H.O.S. Solutions IMMEDIATELY. This includes: graphical glitches, inappropriate language, escapism, or a ■■■■■■■■■</i></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Forever Friend is <strong>a narrative psychological horror game</strong> set in a vintage computer with a girly aesthetic. The players will meet their new Forever Friend, a cute desktop companion, always eager to help and to assist your in your PC activities… until you want to to leave.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948370/extras/81aa3ff58618f53335086062dd57b33d.poster.avif?t=1782483731\" width=450 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948370/extras/81aa3ff58618f53335086062dd57b33d.webm?t=1782483731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948370/extras/81aa3ff58618f53335086062dd57b33d.mp4?t=1782483731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Forever Friend is a <strong>desktop simulator</strong>, set in a computer and fully <strong>interface-based</strong>. As it is non linear, each interactions, mini games or items found will help the player discover new sides of their Forever Friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will need to dig deeper into the computer to put the pieces together and solve the <strong>mysteries</strong> behind their maybe too friendly desktop companion.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948370/extras/838ca96941340c798193b92feac8e375.poster.avif?t=1782483731\" width=450 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948370/extras/838ca96941340c798193b92feac8e375.webm?t=1782483731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948370/extras/838ca96941340c798193b92feac8e375.mp4?t=1782483731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A meta game that confronts the player with their own condition and choices as a video game consumer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unusual mix of genres: psychological horror, virtual companion, and <i>pink game</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An experience on the border between nostalgia, horror, and weirdcore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A disturbing investigation about control relationships and dark secrets of a mysterious technology company.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personal documents rooted in reality: family photos, archives, and found footage.</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948370/extras/gif_03?t=1782483731\" /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948370/extras/357c95c79232daf6a43eb684bdcaedc1.poster.avif?t=1782483731\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948370/extras/357c95c79232daf6a43eb684bdcaedc1.webm?t=1782483731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948370/extras/357c95c79232daf6a43eb684bdcaedc1.mp4?t=1782483731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Forever Friend is the ideal solution to never feel lonely again! Delivered with the perfect Personal Virtual Space, it accompanies you all the time! Play video games, listen to music together, reminisce about buried memories... It's impossible to get bored with a friend! And there are absolutely no problems with it. NONE! ^_^</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If you experience any issues with your Forever Friend, please contact a member of E.C.H.O.S. Solutions IMMEDIATELY. This includes: graphical glitches, inappropriate language, escapism, or a ■■■■■■■■■</i></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Forever Friend is <strong>a narrative psychological horror game</strong> set in a vintage computer with a girly aesthetic. The players will meet their new Forever Friend, a cute desktop companion, always eager to help and to assist your in your PC activities… until you want to to leave.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video clas