 game</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An experience on the border between nostalgia, horror, and weirdcore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A disturbing investigation about control relationships and dark secrets of a mysterious technology company.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personal documents rooted in reality: family photos, archives, and found footage.</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948370/extras/gif_03?t=1782483731\" /></span></p>", "short_description": "Your Forever Friend™ is the solution to never feeling alone again! Play video games, listen to music together, reminisce about buried memories... And there's absolutely nothing wrong with it. NOTHING ! &lt;3", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948370/170686b9fc815e25b90bbcfc88708220a46fbc16/header.jpg?t=1782483731", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948370/90d71c594fea997d46a21762757f04e65a2ab940/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782483731", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948370/90d71c594fea997d46a21762757f04e65a2ab940/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782483731", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core (2.0 GHZ)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated graphics card with 512MB VRAM</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 High Sierra<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong